ATTRIBUTION

This project ports and extends code originally written by Mowokuma in
https://github.com/Mowokuma/ROFL (archived November 2025). That upstream has
no LICENSE file. The upstream author has given explicit permission to port
and build on her work on the condition that she is credited, and CREDITS.md
records that credit in detail.

Nothing in this licence removes or replaces Mowokuma's moral right to be
recognised as the original author of the parser approach, the emulator
strategy, and the handler implementations ported into `src/emulator/` and
`src/packet/handlers/`. See CREDITS.md for the specifics.
